OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CToday:FA dry and cold day with         
OL,6,Fvariable amounts of cloud and some     
OL,7,Fbright or sunny spells. Rather cloudy  
OL,8,Fat times. Freshening southeasterly     
OL,9,Fwinds along exposed coast.             
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry.     
OL,12,FThen the rest of the night will be dry 
OL,13,Fwith clear periods, some cloud around  
OL,14,Fat times. Patchy frost.                
OL,16,CSunday:FDry with variable amounts of   
OL,17,Fcloud and some sunny intervals. Fresh  
OL,18,Fto strong east or southeasterly winds  
OL,19,Falong west coast.                      
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
